# Secret rotations: one entry per rotation, newest last. Append only; never edit or delete an entry.
# An entry names the secret and its identifier, never its value or any part of the value.
#
# YYYY-MM-DD — Rotated <secret name> in <environment> (<scheduled | compromise | departure>) by <person>
#   - Approval: <issue link>, approved by <decider> (<before | after, for a compromise>)
#   - Identifier: old <key id or version> → new <key id or version>
#   - Consumers rolled: <services or workflows that read it>
#   - Verification: <how traffic on the new secret was confirmed, with the time in UTC>
#   - Old secret: disabled <time UTC>, deleted <date>
#   - Audit: <anomalies found in access logs, or "none">
